{"seq":1,"slug":"crux-field-data","title":"CrUX 真实用户数据解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/crux-field-data","wordCount":854,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"crux-真实用户数据解读\">CrUX 真实用户数据解读</h1><p>Chrome User Experience Report（CrUX）是全球最大的公开真实用户性能数据集。Google 搜索排名直接使用 CrUX 数据作为 Core Web Vitals 的评判依据——它不是可选参考，而是 SEO 的硬性通行证。理解 CrUX 的数据收集机制、访问方式和分析技巧，是将性能优化与业务影响挂钩的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CrUX 从全球已启用&quot;使用统计信息&quot;的 Chrome 浏览器用户中匿名收集性能数据，按 28 天滚动窗口聚合，以 P75 为评估标准。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Chrome 用户访问网站] --&gt; B{满足条件?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[匿名上报&lt;br/&gt;LCP/INP/CLS/FCP/TTFB]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[不采集]&#10;    C --&gt; E[CrUX 数据集&lt;br/&gt;28天滚动窗口]&#10;    E --&gt; F[PageSpeed Insights&lt;br/&gt;实时 API]&#10;    E --&gt; G[BigQuery&lt;br/&gt;月度完整数据集]&#10;    E --&gt; H[CrUX API&lt;br/&gt;日级/周级]&#10;    E --&gt; I[Search Console&lt;br/&gt;排名信号]\">graph LR\n    A[Chrome 用户访问网站] --&gt; B{满足条件?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[匿名上报&lt;br/&gt;LCP/INP/CLS/FCP/TTFB]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[不采集]\n    C --&gt; E[CrUX 数据集&lt;br/&gt;28天滚动窗口]\n    E --&gt; F[PageSpeed Insights&lt;br/&gt;实时 API]\n    E --&gt; G[BigQuery&lt;br/&gt;月度完整数据集]\n    E --&gt; H[CrUX API&lt;br/&gt;日级/周级]\n    E --&gt; I[Search Console&lt;br/&gt;排名信号]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>访问方式</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PageSpeed Insights</td>\n<td>URL + Origin</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>快速检查单页表现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CrUX API</td>\n<td>URL + Origin</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n<td>自动化监控管线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CrUX History API</td>\n<td>Origin</td>\n<td>每周（25-40 期）</td>\n<td>趋势分析和回归检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BigQuery 数据集</td>\n<td>Origin</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n<td>深度分析（地理/设备/网络分段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Search Console</td>\n<td>URL 组</td>\n<td>滚动</td>\n<td>SEO 影响评估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据收集的前提条件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户使用 Chrome 浏览器（桌面、Android、iOS 均可）</li>\n<li>Chrome 的&quot;使用统计信息&quot;功能未被禁用（默认开启）</li>\n<li>目标页面/域名达到最低流量阈值（通常月均数百次 Chrome 访问）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"crux-api-程序化访问\">CrUX API 程序化访问</h2><p>CrUX API 支持按 URL 或 Origin 查询最近 28 天的聚合性能数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// CrUX API 查询示例&#10;const API_KEY = &#39;YOUR_API_KEY&#39;;&#10;const endpoint = `https://chromeuxreport.googleapis.com/v1/records:queryRecord?key=${API_KEY}`;&#10;&#10;async function queryCrUX(url: string) {&#10;  const response = await fetch(endpoint, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    body: JSON.stringify({&#10;      url,&#10;      metrics: [&#39;largest_contentful_paint&#39;, &#39;interaction_to_next_paint&#39;, &#39;cumulative_layout_shift&#39;],&#10;    }),&#10;  });&#10;  const data = await response.json();&#10;&#10;  // 解析 P75 值和评级分布&#10;  const lcp = data.record.metrics.largest_contentful_paint;&#10;  console.log(`LCP P75: ${lcp.percentiles.p75}ms`);&#10;  console.log(`Good: ${lcp.histogram[0].density * 100}%`);&#10;  console.log(`NI: ${lcp.histogram[1].density * 100}%`);&#10;  console.log(`Poor: ${lcp.histogram[2].density * 100}%`);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CrUX API 查询示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'YOUR_API_KEY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `https://chromeuxreport.googleapis.com/v1/records:queryRecord?key=${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> queryCrUX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(endpoint, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metrics: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'largest_contentful_paint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'interaction_to_next_paint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cumulative_layout_shift'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 解析 P75 值和评级分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lcp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.record.metrics.largest_contentful_paint;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`LCP P75: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lcp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">percentiles</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p75</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Good: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lcp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">histogram</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">].</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">density</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}%`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`NI: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lcp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">histogram</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">].</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">density</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}%`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Poor: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lcp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">histogram</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">].</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">density</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}%`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CrUX History API 提供时间序列数据，用于检测优化措施生效后的趋势变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function queryCrUXHistory(origin: string) {&#10;  const response = await fetch(endpoint, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    body: JSON.stringify({&#10;      origin,&#10;      metrics: [&#39;interaction_to_next_paint&#39;],&#10;      // 返回最近 25 个收集周期的历史数据&#10;    }),&#10;  });&#10;  const data = await response.json();&#10;  // data.record.metrics.interaction_to_next_paint.percentilesTimeseries.p75s&#10;  // 包含每周的 P75 值，用于绘制趋势图&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> queryCrUXHistory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">origin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(endpoint, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      origin,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metrics: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'interaction_to_next_paint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 返回最近 25 个收集周期的历史数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // data.record.metrics.interaction_to_next_paint.percentilesTimeseries.p75s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 包含每周的 P75 值，用于绘制趋势图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"bigquery-深度分析\">BigQuery 深度分析</h2><p>BigQuery 中的 CrUX 完整数据集支持按国家、网络类型、设备类型等维度切片分析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查询特定域名的 INP 表现，按国家和设备分段&#10;SELECT&#10;  origin,&#10;  country_code,&#10;  form_factor.name AS device,&#10;  p75_inp,&#10;  -- 计算 Good/NI/Poor 占比&#10;  good_inp_density,&#10;  ni_inp_density,&#10;  poor_inp_density&#10;FROM `chrome-ux-report.materialized.device_summary`&#10;WHERE origin = &#39;https://example.com&#39;&#10;  AND date = &#39;2026-06-01&#39;&#10;ORDER BY poor_inp_density DESC&#10;LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询特定域名的 INP 表现，按国家和设备分段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  country_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  form_factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p75_inp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 计算 Good/NI/Poor 占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  good_inp_density,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ni_inp_density,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  poor_inp_density</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `chrome-ux-report.materialized.device_summary`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'https://example.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-06-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> poor_inp_density </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 跟踪某 origin 的月度 LCP P75 变化趋势&#10;SELECT&#10;  yyyymm,&#10;  p75_lcp&#10;FROM `chrome-ux-report.materialized.metrics_summary`&#10;WHERE origin = &#39;https://example.com&#39;&#10;ORDER BY yyyymm DESC&#10;LIMIT 12;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 跟踪某 origin 的月度 LCP P75 变化趋势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  yyyymm,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p75_lcp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `chrome-ux-report.materialized.metrics_summary`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'https://example.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> yyyymm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BigQuery 分析的关键发现模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析维度</th>\n<th>常见洞察</th>\n<th>对应行动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按国家</td>\n<td>特定地区 LCP 显著高于全局</td>\n<td>检查 CDN 覆盖 / 增加边缘节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按设备</td>\n<td>移动端 INP 远差于桌面</td>\n<td>针对中低端设备优化 JS 执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按网络</td>\n<td>4G 用户 LCP 超标</td>\n<td>降低首屏资源体积 / 启用压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按 URL 组</td>\n<td>某类页面模板 CLS 异常</td>\n<td>检查该模板的动态内容插入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"crux-的局限性与补充\">CrUX 的局限性与补充</h2><p>CrUX 虽然权威，但存在明确的局限：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>仅 Chrome 数据</strong>：Safari、Firefox 用户不在采集范围，移动端尤其明显</li>\n<li><strong>28 天延迟</strong>：部署优化后需要等待整个窗口滚动才能看到效果</li>\n<li><strong>流量阈值</strong>：低流量页面可能无 URL 级数据（只有 Origin 级）</li>\n<li><strong>无会话上下文</strong>：只有聚合统计，无法追溯到具体用户/会话</li>\n<li><strong>中国大陆局限</strong>：Chrome 市场份额低 + Google 服务可能被阻断</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些局限说明 CrUX 不能单独使用——它需要 RUM 平台补充会话级上下文、覆盖非 Chrome 用户、提供实时性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化监控管线\">自动化监控管线</h2><p>将 CrUX 数据集成到团队的监控工作流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 每日 CrUX 检查 + Slack 告警&#10;async function dailyCrUXCheck(origins: string[]) {&#10;  for (const origin of origins) {&#10;    const data = await queryCrUX(origin);&#10;    const metrics = data.record.metrics;&#10;&#10;    const alerts: string[] = [];&#10;    if (metrics.largest_contentful_paint.percentiles.p75 &gt; 2500) {&#10;      alerts.push(`LCP P75 = ${metrics.largest_contentful_paint.percentiles.p75}ms (&gt; 2.5s)`);&#10;    }&#10;    if (metrics.interaction_to_next_paint.percentiles.p75 &gt; 200) {&#10;      alerts.push(`INP P75 = ${metrics.interaction_to_next_paint.percentiles.p75}ms (&gt; 200ms)`);&#10;    }&#10;    if (metrics.cumulative_layout_shift.percentiles.p75 &gt; 0.1) {&#10;      alerts.push(`CLS P75 = ${metrics.cumulative_layout_shift.percentiles.p75} (&gt; 0.1)`);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (alerts.length &gt; 0) {&#10;      await sendSlackAlert(origin, alerts);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每日 CrUX 检查 + Slack 告警</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dailyCrUXCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">origins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origins) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> queryCrUX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(origin);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.record.metrics;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> alerts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (metrics.largest_contentful_paint.percentiles.p75 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      alerts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`LCP P75 = ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metrics</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">largest_contentful_paint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">percentiles</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p75</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms (> 2.5s)`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (metrics.interaction_to_next_paint.percentiles.p75 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      alerts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`INP P75 = ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metrics</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">interaction_to_next_paint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">percentiles</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p75</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms (> 200ms)`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (metrics.cumulative_layout_shift.percentiles.p75 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      alerts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`CLS P75 = ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metrics</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cumulative_layout_shift</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">percentiles</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p75</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} (> 0.1)`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (alerts.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendSlackAlert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(origin, alerts);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CrUX 是 Google 排名使用的真实用户性能数据源，以 28 天 P75 评估</li>\n<li>四种访问方式覆盖从快速检查到深度分析的完整场景</li>\n<li>BigQuery 支持按国家/设备/网络分段，定位特定用户群体的性能瓶颈</li>\n<li>CrUX 的局限（仅 Chrome、28 天延迟、无会话上下文）需要 RUM 平台补充</li>\n<li>自动化管线应每日查询 CrUX API，阈值触发即告警</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"rum-platforms\">RUM 平台选型与对比</a>——补充 CrUX 无法覆盖的实时性和会话级分析能力</li>\n<li><a href=\"../web-performance-vitals/delivery/perf-budget-ci\">Web 性能优化 — 性能预算与 CI</a>——将 CrUX 趋势作为性能预算调整的依据</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CrUX 真实用户数据解读","id":"crux-真实用户数据解读"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CrUX API 程序化访问","id":"crux-api-程序化访问"},{"level":2,"text":"BigQuery 深度分析","id":"bigquery-深度分析"},{"level":2,"text":"CrUX 的局限性与补充","id":"crux-的局限性与补充"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化监控管线","id":"自动化监控管线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"自定义指标采集与上报链路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/collection/custom-metrics-collection"},"next":{"title":"RUM 平台选型与对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/rum-platforms"}}